  "notes": [
    "Machine-generated J.A.R.V.I.S. HUD token map for the DSH Web UI.",
    "Source: packages/client/ui-theme/src/styles/design-platform.css (108 --dsw-alias-* tokens, light block on body / dark block on body[data-ds-dark-theme]); var() chains resolved recursively per mode, including chained aliases and color-mix() expressions.",
    "Static usage collected from packages/client/**/*.css excluding ui-theme/src/styles: 19 distinct --dsw-static-* tokens consumed directly by components.",
    "Mapping: background ramp (deepest/base/three surfaces), text ramp (primary/secondary/tertiary-disabled), cyan accent family for brand/link/info/primary-button/state-business, amber for warn, red for error/danger, green for success/done, cyan-tinted borders and interactive washes, navy shades for illustrations, glass alphas for menus/toolbars.",
    "Translucent source tokens keep translucency with Jarvis-tinted rgba(); fully transparent borders stay rgba(0,0,0,0). Masks preserve their original alpha.",
    "Neutral statics map to the nearest navy/white ramp step by luminance in each mode; brand/deepseek/blue statics map to the cyan accent, amber statics to amber/gold, green/red statics to green/red.",
    "Darwin-only menu overrides (html[data-platform=darwin]) are ignored; the base body/dark values are used.",
    "Uncertain mappings: state-done-primary (source violet) mapped to green as a completed state; scrollbar thumb/hover mapped to cyan-tinted translucent steps rather than a neutral ramp step; illustration backing/detail/inset/shadow chosen as navy shades by hand; label-dimmed kept as a translucent dim text; bg-document-selection kept as a cyan wash (source was a 40% blue color-mix); tooltip-key-bg computed as mapped tooltip-bg + white 18%."
  ]
}
